I used `git blame -w -M -C` on every `.py` file at HEAD. I excluded the two formatting commits (`abe2ea7` black and `0e8fe2e` pre-commit.ci). Without that exclusion, the formatters would show up as owners of lines they only reflowed. Line counts below are from that run.

