"Dana Okafor" (`<email redacted>`) and "dana okafor" (`dokafor@fastmail.example`) appear as two authors. The repo has no `.mailmap` entry linking them. I assumed they are the same person because the name matches apart from case. Confirm that before contacting either address. Adding a `.mailmap` entry would fix this in future tooling.
